    "text": "A ratio of the <math><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term from the beginning to the <math><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term from the end in the binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup></math> is",
