  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Total number of terms in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term from end&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;from beginning.</p><p>We need to find a&nbsp;ratio of the <math><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term from the beginning to the <math><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term from the end (i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>7</mn><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;term from beginning)&nbsp;in the binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>10</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow/><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow/><mn>10</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></mstyle><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mrow><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3<